<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: right; text-indent: 0.5in">Emerging growth company <span id="xdx_90C_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20250403__20250403_z1pClRJv8qHb"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2025-04-03" format="ixt:booleantrue" id="Fact000029" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#9746;</ix:nonNumeric></span></p>

