provided pursuant to Section 13(a) of the Exchange Act. <span id="xdx_90C_edei--EntityExTransitionPeriod_c20250403__20250403_zLdkW5RB4fHi"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2025-04-03" format="ixt:booleanfalse" id="Fact000030" name="dei:EntityExTransitionPeriod">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></span></p>

